# Scheduling / optimization
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# We keep the triangular dependency in the outer i loop (must stay serial),
# but optimize the inner j loop:
#  - Tile j by a small constant factor to improve locality and enable
#    better vectorization and ILP.
#  - Fully unroll the inner tile loop so the compiler can generate
#    straight-line code for the main body of the dot product.
#
