# --------------------------
# We now transform kernel_trisolv_base into an optimized version.
# The main optimizations are:
#   1. Tiling and unrolling the inner j-loop to increase instruction-level
#      parallelism and expose a regular inner loop for the backend compiler.
#   2. Leaving the i-loop sequential because of the true dependence
#      x[i] -> x[i+1] (forward substitution cannot be parallelized in i).

